          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown on the timeline as pickup and return markers on their own days. The rental car itself stays under All-day & stays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "時刻付きの予定一覧に、それぞれの日の貸出・返却の目印として表示します。レンタカー自体は「終日・滞在情報」に残ります。"
